<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Yabeng cautions shareholders on stake sale.</title>
<headline>Yabeng cautions shareholders on stake sale.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Yabeng Investment Holding Co Ltd said on Friday that a disposal of a stake in the firm by the North West Development Corp Ltd is still under way.</p>
<p>The stake is being sold by public tender.</p>
<p>&quot;Shareholders are accordingly advised to continue to exercise caution when dealing in the company's shares,&quot; the firm added.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
